.TH MYSTRCAT 3 "2026" "libmyutils" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrcat \- concatenate two strings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrcat(char *" dest ", const char *" src ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Appends a copy of the string
.I src
to the end of the string
.I dest.
Returns the resulting length of dest.
